{"page":285,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:28","surah":17,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا تُعْرِضَنَّ عَنْهُمُ ٱبْتِغَآءَ رَحْمَةٍ مِّن رَّبِّكَ تَرْجُوهَا فَقُل لَّهُمْ قَوْلًا مَّيْسُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but if, while seeking some bounty that you expect from your Lord, you turn them down, then at least speak some word of comfort to them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِمَّا","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-immā","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُعْرِضَنَّ","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"tuʿ'riḍanna","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنْهُمُ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhumu","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱبْتِغَآءَ","en_gloss":"seeking","transliteration":"ib'tighāa","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَحْمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatin","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَرْجُوهَا","en_gloss":"which you expect","transliteration":"tarjūhā","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَقُل","en_gloss":"then say","transliteration":"faqul","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَوْلًۭا","en_gloss":"a word","transliteration":"qawlan","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّيْسُورًۭا","en_gloss":"gentle","transliteration":"maysūran","verse_key":"17:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:28"}]},{"verse_key":"17:29","surah":17,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَجْعَلْ يَدَكَ مَغْلُولَةً إِلَىٰ عُنُقِكَ وَلَا تَبْسُطْهَا كُلَّ ٱلْبَسْطِ فَتَقْعُدَ مَلُومًا مَّحْسُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not be tight-fisted, nor so open-handed that you end up blamed and overwhelmed with regret.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"17