ngfully, We have given authority to the defender of his rights, but he should not be excessive in taking life, for he is already aided [by God].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقْتُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"kill","transliteration":"taqtulū","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّفْسَ","en_gloss":"the soul","transliteration":"l-nafsa","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"Allah has forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has forbidden","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۗ","en_gloss":"by right","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قُتِلَ","en_gloss":"(is) killed","transliteration":"qutila","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَظْلُومًۭا","en_gloss":"wrongfully","transliteration":"maẓlūman","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"verily","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِوَلِيِّهِۦ","en_gloss":"for his heir","transliteration":"liwaliyyihi","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","en_gloss":"an authority","transliteration":"sul'ṭānan","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يُسْرِف","en_gloss":"he should exceed","transliteration":"yus'rif","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِّى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"17:33"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْقَتْلِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the killing","transliteration":"l-qatli","verse